l, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1822615992421086", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/786297305_1822615995754419_6149783115424784690_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-qCWN2FLn8Q7kNvwFqcoPv&_nc_oc=Adq3f7Y-C5PAVx03V3D9DBE58ujscYYtPcmD3JRLXduqj6SQnGUkSXzWFJrhvIdQweA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_9kzO3q8yabKKUuPN5wopTsNAyPgxVjpo804yd2HriQ&oe=6AF0A4D7"}, "display_name": "XR Eye Trainer", "keywords": ["eyes", "exercises", "vision", "training", "passthrough"], "long_description": "XR Eye Trainer turns classic eye-movement drills into short Mixed Reality routines. You see your own room through passthrough, follow a target with your eyes and keep your head still.\n\nHow to start\nPut on the headset: a start panel appears in front of you. Choose \"Start guided session\" or pick a single exercise. Exercises end on their own and bring you back to the menu.\n\nGuided session\nA ready-made routine: vertical and horizontal tracking, diagonals, rectangles in both directions and clock-face target hops, with short pauses to blink and rest.\n\nSingle exercises\nSmooth pursuit: Vertical, Horizontal, Diagonals A and B, Square, Diamond, Circle CW and CCW, Lemniscate.\nSaccades: Target Hop, quick jumps between points to sharpen focus shifts.\nEach exercise runs 10 full cycles and stops.\n\nMade for comfort\n- Mixed Reality: you always see your surroundings\n- Works with hands or controllers\n- Wrist menu: speed, target size, trajectory size, room dimming\n- Gentle tick sounds keep the rhythm; a reminder appears if your head moves\n- Fully offline, no account, no ads\n\nDisclaimer: XR Eye Trainer is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice. If you have any vision concerns, please consult a qualified eye-care professional.", "short_description": "Eye exercises in Mixed Reality. See your room through passthrough, follow the target with your eyes and keep 